              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Richard A. Cordray, counsel for the petitioners opened by representing current and former government officials sued in their individual capacity over denial of court access and qualified immunity."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Rehnquist",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3adc3796d5fbe028c595d0872ba8370ad2f608cf7edd039b4f9eb2f22a760638",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3adc3796d5fb-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Rehnquist, chief Justice Rehnquist announced that the Court would hear argument in No.\u202f01\u2011394, Warren Christopher v. Jennifer K. Harbury."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Rehnquist",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3adc3796d5fbe028c595d0872ba8370ad2f608cf7edd039b4f9eb2f22a760638",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3adc3796d5fb-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Rehnquist, justices questioned the right of access, referencing the Bell v. Milwaukee case and the Bivens doctrine."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3adc3796d5fbe028c595d0872ba8370ad2f608cf7edd039b4f9eb2f22a760638",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3adc3796d5fb-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "3adc3796d5fbe028c595d0872ba8370ad2f608cf7edd039b4f9eb2f22a760638",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3adc3796d5fb-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, the Court asked whether alleged statements were made to prevent a lawsuit, indicating concern over potential misuse of governmental information."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3adc3796d5fbe028c595d0872ba8370ad2f608cf7edd039b4f9eb2f22a760638",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3adc3796d5fb-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court noted that the government may legitimately provide false information in certain situations."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. Harbury",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3adc3796d5fbe028c595d0872ba8370ad2f608cf7edd039b4f9eb2f22a760638",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3adc3796d5fb-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 35,
              "start": 35
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Ms. Harbury, harbury described the alleged conduct as intentional deceit, a common\u2011law tort where the deceiver knows the statement will be relied upon to the detriment of another."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. Harbury",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3adc3796d5fbe028c595d0872ba8370ad2f608cf7edd039b4f9eb2f22a760638",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-3adc3796d5fb-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Harbury explained that she filed a FOIA request in January 1995, received disclosures in March, and later obtained additional documentation in the fall."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3adc3796d5fbe028c595d0872ba8370ad2f608cf7edd039b4f9eb2f22a760638",
            "evidence_ids": [
